<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2b1576-en-59d2d619" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of  into (English)</title><editor role="translator">AI - Gemini</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2b1576"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-04-06T19:20:38.117+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2b1576-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Among all species and their distinct ranks,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">none can compare to humans.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">You can tread upon the square earth as if measuring it with a carpenter's square,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and carry a compass as if to model the heavens.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">You encompass the mysteries of profound essence,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and manifest harmonious *qì* (氣) in the vast unknown.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Thus, your spirit comprehends all wisdom,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.13" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and your thoughts penetrate everything seamlessly.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.14" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">When you soar (in writing), your passion overcomes mighty waves;</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.15" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">when you utter eloquent words, your arguments untangle the most intricate puzzles.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.16" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Why do you not leap from the abyss</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.17" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and shine with the brilliance of the sun?</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.18" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Cause your outstanding talent to rise from Yánggǔ (暘谷),</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.19" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and your radiance to overflow from Fúsāng (扶桑).</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.20" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Looking down, you would experience the glory of the manifested sage;</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.21" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">looking up, you would gather in the hall of heaven and man.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.22" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Although your attire</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.23" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">is both profound and plain,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.24" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">now you are stalled,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.25" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and your years are already waning.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.26" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Yet your ceremonial cap has not changed (to one of higher rank),</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.27" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and your carriage has not been upgraded.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.28" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Why do you not make the dark sable (decoration) hang on the left (of your cap), and the splendid cicada (decoration) look to the right?</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.29" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Cause your ox in the morning to pull a green carriage,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.30" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and in the evening to drive a light, grand chariot,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.31" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">gazing towards the Zǐwēi (紫微) Palace, you would travel like the wind;</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.32" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">treading upon a fragrant path, you would walk with ease.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.33" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Instead, you traverse rugged Lǒng (隴) Mountain slopes,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.34" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and rest your carriage in the pastures of the countryside,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.35" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">your dignified face filled with sorrow,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.36" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">and your lonely ox suffering from illness?</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.37" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">Why do you so greatly revere the Dào (道) and virtue,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.38" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">yet so severely neglect honor and riches!</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_006-38a.39" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T19:21:17.718+09:00">The days and months are passing away!</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Your servant Yún says:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Your servant previously proposed that one could, with teachers, friends, and literary scholars, read books and discuss the Way.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Now, furthermore, the weather is clear and suitable,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">it is precisely the day for lecturing and reciting.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Your servant has heard that the height of lofty mountains</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">is never deemed too steep;</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">the capacity of the blue sea</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.13" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">is limitless in its vastness.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.14" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Therefore, the Duke of Zhōu (Zhōu Gōng), though handling myriad affairs in a single day,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.15" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">still broadly consulted a hundred chapters;</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.16" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Confucius (Kǒngzǐ), even during his leisure years, devoted himself to poring over texts,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.17" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">to the point where the leather thongs binding his bamboo slips broke three times.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.18" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">From this, it can be said that,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.19" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">even with the immense wisdom of sages,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.20" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">they still could not but seek it through learning.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.21" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">I humbly reflect that Your Royal Highness's bright virtue is radiant and extensive,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.22" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">your natural endowment is outstanding and clear.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.23" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">It is appropriate that you should now glorify and develop civil and military arts,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.24" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">and truly follow the imperial Way.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.25" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">If you further apply your concentration to the profundities of ancient and modern times,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.26" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">and respectfully peruse the records of a thousand years,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.27" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">then spiritual insight and sagely wisdom</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.28" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">will illuminate all things.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.29" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Moreover, the teachers, friends, and literary scholars,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.30" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">selected by the court from the multitude,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.31" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">come to teach with their virtue.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.32" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Although generous emoluments and great respect</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.33" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">have already been bestowed upon those individuals,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.34" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">yet the Way of the former kings</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.35" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">has not yet been thoroughly presented to Your Sagely Ear.</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1576_CHANT_009-11a.36" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-06T20:57:38.301+09:00">Having been in office for several years,</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>